problem. The observed trajectory over the period [1, Tobs] is represented as X = {xt ∈ R3|t = 1, 2, 3, ⋯, Tobs
}, where xt denotes the 3D location of the target at observation time t in coordinates. Similarly, the predicted trajectory at the current moment Tobs can be denoted
as Y = {xt ∈ R3|t = Tobs + 1, ⋯, Tobs +Tpred
